---
// 安禾播放器系列家族互通导流模块
---

<section class="section family-section" id="family">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">全端生态</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        探索安禾播放器<span class="gradient-text">系列家族</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        除了强大的 PC 桌面客户端，安禾播放器系列还提供移动端随身播放器与轻量音乐下载器，全场景覆盖你的音乐生活。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="family-grid">
      <!-- 移动端卡片 -->
      <a href="/mobile" class="family-card color-block-lilac reveal">
        <div class="family-card-head">
          <div class="family-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"/>
              <path d="M12 18h.01"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="family-badge">Android · 掌上随享</span>
        </div>
        <h3>安禾播放器 移动端</h3>
        <p>
          遵循 Google Material 3 动态美学打造，内置 QuickJS 洛雪脚本沙箱，多源秒速切换，集成 10 档专业 AutoEQ 硬件级音效预设。
        </p>
        <div class="family-card-foot">
          <span class="foot-tech">Kotlin · Compose · Media3</span>
          <span class="foot-arrow">立即了解 →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 下载器卡片 -->
      <a href="/downloader" class="family-card color-block-coral reveal" style="transition-delay: 80ms">
        <div class="family-card-head">
          <div class="family-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8Z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="family-badge">Windows · 单文件 9.3MB</span>
        </div>
        <h3>风宝音乐下载器</h3>
        <p>
          Go + 原生 Edge WebView2 架构，免安装双击秒开。四源聚合检索，下载自动写入 ID3v2.3 规范，内嵌 500px 封面与滚动歌词。
        </p>
        <div class="family-card-foot">
          <span class="foot-tech">Go 1.26 · WebView2 · ID3v2.3</span>
          <span class="foot-arrow">立即了解 →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 音源监测卡片 -->
      <a href="/sources" class="family-card color-block-mint reveal" style="transition-delay: 160ms">
        <div class="family-card-head">
          <div class="family-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="family-badge">自动化监测 · 每 4 小时</span>
        </div>
        <h3>洛雪音源可用性监测</h3>
        <p>
          由 GitHub Actions 每 4 小时模拟真实洛雪运行时，对各大平台测试歌曲发起拉流校验，保障播放器音源持久可用。
        </p>
        <div class="family-card-foot">
          <span class="foot-tech">Actions · 自动化校验 · 实时流</span>
          <span class="foot-arrow">查看状态 →</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .family-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .family-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 36px 30px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .family-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
    border-color: var(--primary);
  }

  .family-card-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .family-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--canvas);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .family-icon svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }

  .family-badge {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .family-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .family-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.64;
    color: var(--ink);
    opacity: 0.72;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    flex: 1;
    font-weight: 350;
  }

  .family-card-foot {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .foot-tech {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .foot-arrow {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .family-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
